{"id":65241,"date":"2026-08-30T13:23:47","date_gmt":"2026-08-30T12:23:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=65241"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:48:15","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:48:15","slug":"sao-silvestre-espinho","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-espinho\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Espinho 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Espinho 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Espinho 2027<\/strong> (12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>3 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, com partida da corrida principal \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>, na cidade costeira de <strong>Espinho<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Conhecida como uma das corridas mais animadas do pa\u00eds, a prova abre o novo ano desportivo com anima\u00e7\u00e3o de coletividades locais ao longo de todo o percurso e um tra\u00e7ado r\u00e1pido com partida e chegada junto \u00e0 <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Espinho<\/strong> (Rua 20).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Em plena malha urbana ortogonal caracter\u00edstica de Espinho \u2014 c\u00e9lebre pelas suas ruas numeradas, tradi\u00e7\u00e3o piscat\u00f3ria de arte x\u00e1vega e frente atl\u00e2ntica \u2014, o programa desportivo integra a competitiva <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (limitada a 3.000 atletas e com b\u00f3nus especial para quem superar o recorde absoluto de 29:40), uma <strong>Caminhada<\/strong> conv\u00edvio (at\u00e9 1.750 participantes) e a <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Kids \u2013 Kids Race Experience<\/strong> (~300 metros para crian\u00e7as dos 4 aos 12 anos).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado conjuntamente pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Espinho<\/strong> e pelo <strong>Running Espinho<\/strong>, contando com a supervis\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Aveiro<\/strong> e o apoio da PSP, GNR e Bombeiros do Concelho de Espinho. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3 de Janeiro de 2027 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Espinho, Rua 20, Espinho, Aveiro<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km (Corrida), Caminhada e 300 m (Kids Race Experience)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapsh