,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (vagas limitadas)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2 \u2014 501+ inscr. (s\/ T-shirt | c\/ T-shirt):<\/strong> 9,00 \u20ac | 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/12)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Kids (Kids Race Experience)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 3 Jan<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica (1 a 250 inscr.):<\/strong> 3,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/12)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de Espinho 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Espinho 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>3 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, com partida da corrida principal de 10 km \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>. A partida e a chegada est\u00e3o instaladas junto \u00e0 <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Espinho<\/strong>, na Rua 20, em Espinho (distrito de Aveiro), com tempo limite de 2 horas (encerra \u00e0s 12:00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as provas e limites de participa\u00e7\u00e3o do evento?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 composto por tr\u00eas provas: a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> cronometrada (aberta a maiores de 18 anos, limite de 3.000 participantes), a <strong>Caminhada<\/strong> n\u00e3o competitiva (limite de 1.750 participantes) e a <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Kids \u2013 Kids Race Experience<\/strong> com cerca de 300 metros para crian\u00e7as dos 4 aos 12 anos (limite de 250 participantes).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es online encerram a <strong>30 de dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 23:59<\/strong> e variam por lotes de inscritos: nos <strong>10 km<\/strong> custam de 10,00 \u20ac a 15,00 \u20ac (sem camisola) ou de 16,00 \u20ac a 21,00 \u20ac (com camisola t\u00e9cnica) ao longo de 6 fases; na <strong>Caminhada<\/strong> custam 8,00 \u20ac a 9,00 \u20ac (sem camisola) ou 14,00 \u20ac a 15,00 \u20ac (com camisola); e na <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Kids<\/strong> t\u00eam o valor \u00fanico de 3,00 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento do kit de atleta e dorsal?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os dorsais e kits de participa\u00e7\u00e3o s\u00e3o entregues nos dias <strong>1 e 2 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong> no <strong>Edif\u00edcio Pra\u00e7a Progresso<\/strong>, na Rua 8, em Espinho. No dia da prova (3 de janeiro) apenas s\u00e3o entregues dorsais a atletas residentes a mais de 25 km de Espinho que tenham efetuado reserva pr\u00e9via confirmada para o e-mail <em>reservas.saosilvestreespinho@gmail.com<\/em>.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a prova e quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios em disputa?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Espinho<\/strong> e pelo <strong>Running Espinho<\/strong>, com arbitragem da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Aveiro. Nos 10 km h\u00e1 pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para o Top 5 da Geral M\/F (500 \u20ac, 300 \u20ac, 200 \u20ac, 150 \u20ac e 100 \u20ac), trof\u00e9us para os 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o e um pr\u00e9mio extra de 500 \u20ac para a quebra do recorde absoluto da prova (29:40).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Espinho 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-03\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-03\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Espinho, Aveiro\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Espinho\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 12\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Espinho realiza-se a 3 de janeiro de 2027 \u00e0s 10:00, com corrida de 10 km, caminhada e Kids Race. Consulta o percurso e inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-sao-silvestre-espinho.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/ss-espinho-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada\", \"price\": \"8.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.